            sh:resultMessage "Advisory: every work item satisfying this deliverable is still open, so the boundary is met by INTENTION rather than by delivery. Found by measurement on this register: ten of ten deliverables read satisfied while only seven were satisfied by Done work — planning three epics moved a coverage figure that should only move when something ships. Coverage counted over claimed satisfaction is the backlog measuring itself again, one level along from where that was last corrected." ;
            sh:resultSeverity sh:Warning ;
            sh:sourceConstraint [ a sh:SPARQLConstraint ;
                    sh:message "Advisory: every work item satisfying this deliverable is still open, so the boundary is met by INTENTION rather than by delivery. Found by measurement on this register: ten of ten deliverables read satisfied while only seven were satisfied by Done work — planning three epics moved a coverage figure that should only move when something ships. Coverage counted over claimed satisfaction is the backlog measuring itself again, one level along from where that was last corrected." ;
                    sh:prefixes [ sh:declare [ sh:namespace "http://example.org/backlog#"^^xsd:anyURI ;
